flowchart TB
 HOOK[User Prompt / Doc Annotation] --> INDEX[Incremental REQ Candidate Index]
 INDEX --> NEMA[.NEMA Node-Edge DAG]
 NEMA --> A[FileSpace A Analysis]
 NEMA --> B[FileSpace B Tests]
 NEMA --> C[FileSpace C Security]
 A --> PLAN[Proposed Diffs]
 B --> PLAN
 C --> PLAN
 PLAN --> APPROVAL{Human Approval?}
 APPROVAL -->|no| STOP[Reject]
 APPROVAL -->|yes| VERSION{expected SHA matches?}
 VERSION -->|no| CONFLICT[409 Conflict / Rebase]
 VERSION -->|yes| COMMIT[Commit Coordinator]
 COMMIT --> EVENTS[New Version + Event + Governance Log]
